{"id": "78454cd7-f032-45bd-b227-f1c12fd0b8b4", "slug": "nexus-core-infrastructure", "title": "Nexus® | Core Infrastructure", "description": "Nexus Core Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.", "content": "---\nversion: \"neuform-top-creators-featured\"\nname: \"Nexus® | Core Infrastructure\"\ndescription: \"Nexus Core Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\"\ncolors:\n  primary: \"#0096FF\"\n  secondary: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  accent: \"#64FFFF\"\n  background: \"#FFFFFF\"\n  surface: \"#C8FFFF\"\n  text-primary: \"#111827\"\n  text-secondary: \"#4B5563\"\n  border: \"#E5E7EB\"\ntypography:\n  display-lg:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"64px\"\n    fontWeight: 500\n    lineHeight: \"1.04\"\n    letterSpacing: \"0\"\n  body-md:\n    fontFamily: \"Inter\"\n    fontSize: \"16px\"\n    fontWeight: 400\n    lineHeight: \"1.6\"\n  label-md:\n    fontFamily: \"JetBrains Mono\"\n    fontSize: \"12px\"\n    fontWeight: 600\n    lineHeight: \"1.2\"\nspacing:\n  base: \"8px\"\n  gap: \"16px\"\n  card-padding: \"24px\"\n  section-padding: \"80px\"\nrounded:\n  card: \"8px\"\n  control: \"8px\"\n  pill: \"9999px\"\ncomponents:\n  card:\n    background: \"Use the surface token with subtle borders and HTML-matched shadow depth\"\n    radius: \"Match the declared card radius token\"\n  button:\n    background: \"Use primary or accent colors for the main action\"\n    radius: \"Use the control or pill radius based on the source HTML\"\n---\n# Nexus® | Core Infrastructure\nSource: Neuform Featured templates from top creators. Author: Sourasith Phomhome (@madebysourasith). Views: 17; favorites: 11; remixes: 1.\nTags: card, animated, webgl, threejs, action, effect.\n## Overview\nNexus Core Card Component is designed for building reusable UI components in modern web projects. Key features include reusable structure, responsive behavior, and production-ready presentation. It is suitable for component libraries and responsive product interfaces.\n\nNexus ® Solutions Heritage Insights Connect Gain Entry We engineer systems to accelerate your global operations Initialize ® Nexus ® Premier AI Collective, we leverage the Quantum Matrix Core and Synapse Framework to el…\n## Composition\nUse the attached HTML reference as the source of truth. Preserve the visible hierarchy, first-screen composition, section rhythm, density, and interaction tone before adapting copy or content.\nKey visible headings include: Nexus ®.\n## Colors\nAnchor the palette in primary #0096FF, secondary #FFFFFF, accent #64FFFF, background #FFFFFF, surface #C8FFFF, text-primary #111827. Keep background, surface, text, and border roles distinct so generated layouts retain the same contrast pattern as the source.\n## Typography\nUse Inter for display moments and Inter for body copy unless the HTML clearly demands a compatible fallback. Labels and technical metadata should use JetBrains Mono or an equivalent mono face.\n## Layout\nKeep spacing deliberate and stable. Favor the same grid direction, max-width behavior, card density, and responsive stacking seen in the HTML. Do not replace distinctive source structures with generic SaaS sections.\n## Components\nCards, buttons, badges, navigation, and repeated blocks should preserve the source geometry, border treatment, and hover feel.\n## Motion\nPreserve existing motion cues such as masked reveals, staggered entrance, hover lift, scroll-triggered transitions, and ambient movement. Keep easing smooth and restrained.\n## WebGL & Effects\n\nIf the source includes canvas, WebGL, Three.js, gradients, particles, or atmospheric effects, rebuild them as supporting layers behind the content. Keep effects performant, responsive, and secondary to the interface.\n\n## Guardrails\n- Do not flatten the source into a generic card grid.\n- Do not swap the color mode unless the source clearly supports it.\n- Preserve the first viewport signal, focal object, and visual density.\n- Keep buttons, cards, and badges aligned to the same radius and border language.", "preview_html": "<!DOCTYPE html>\n<html lang=\"en\" class=\"dark\">\n<head>\n    <meta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n    <meta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n    <title>Nexus® | Core Infrastructure</title>\n    <script src=\"https://cdn.tailwindcss.com\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://code.iconify.design/iconify-icon/1.0.7/iconify-icon.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/gsap/3.12.2/gsap.min.js\"></script>\n    <script src=\"https://cdnjs.cloudflare.com/ajax/libs/three.js/r128/three.min.js\"></script>\n\n    <style>\n        @import url('https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600&display=swap');\n\n        body {\n            font-family: 'Inter', sans-serif;\n            background-color: #000407; /* Deep, near-black teal/navy tone */\n            color: #ffffff;\n            overflow-x: hidden;\n            -webkit-font-smoothing: antialiased;\n        }\n\n        /* Container Lines Skill */\n        .container-lines {\n            position: fixed;\n            inset: 0;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 50;\n            display: flex;\n            justify-content: space-between;\n            max-width: 80rem; /* max-w-7xl */\n            margin: 0 auto;\n            padding: 0 2rem;\n        }\n        .container-line {\n            width: 1px;\n            height: 100vh;\n            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, transparent, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 10%, rgba(255,255,255,0.03) 90%, transparent);\n            position: relative;\n        }\n        .container-line::before, .container-line::after {\n            content: '';\n            position: absolute;\n            width: 3px;\n            height: 3px;\n            background: rgba(255,255,255,0.1);\n            left: -1px;\n        }\n        .container-line::before { top: 10%; }\n        .container-line::after { bottom: 10%; }\n\n        /* The specific intense gradient beam */\n        .neon-beam-core {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: -20%;\n            left: -15%;\n            width: 120vw;\n            height: 50vh;\n            transform: rotate(-22deg);\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(255,255,255,1) 0%, rgba(100,255,255,0.9) 15%, rgba(0,120,255,0.6) 40%, transparent 80%);\n            filter: blur(60px);\n            mix-blend-mode: screen;\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 1;\n        }\n        .neon-beam-glow {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: -30%;\n            left: -20%;\n            width: 150vw;\n            height: 80vh;\n            transform: rotate(-22deg);\n            background: linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(200,255,255,0.5) 0%, rgba(20,130,255,0.3) 30%, transparent 70%);\n            filter: blur(100px);\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 0;\n        }\n\n        /* Subtle dot grid on the right */\n        .dot-grid-bg {\n            position: fixed;\n            inset: 0;\n            background-image: radial-gradient(circle at center, rgba(255,255,255,0.15) 1px, transparent 1px);\n            background-size: 32px 32px;\n            mask-image: linear-gradient(to left, black 10%, transparent 60%);\n            -webkit-mask-image: linear-gradient(to left, black 10%, transparent 60%);\n            pointer-events: none;\n            z-index: 2;\n            opacity: 0.6;\n        }\n\n        /* WebGL Canvas */\n        #webgl-canvas {\n            position: fixed;\n            top: 0;\n            left: 0;\n            width: 100vw;\n            height: 100vh;\n            z-index: 3;\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Custom 3D Glass Cube */\n        :root {\n            --cube-size: 260px;\n        }\n        @media (max-width: 768px) { :root { --cube-size: 180px; } }\n\n        .scene-3d {\n            perspective: 1000px;\n            width: var(--cube-size);\n            height: var(--cube-size);\n        }\n        .cube-wrapper {\n            position: relative;\n            width: 100%;\n            height: 100%;\n            transform-style: preserve-3d;\n            transform: rotateX(-20deg) rotateY(35deg) rotateZ(-5deg);\n        }\n        .cube-face {\n            position: absolute;\n            width: var(--cube-size);\n            height: var(--cube-size);\n            border: 1px solid rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.4);\n            backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n            -webkit-backdrop-filter: blur(8px);\n        }\n\n        /* Front Face (Teal/Blue Glass) */\n        .face-front {\n            transform: translateZ(calc(var(--cube-size) / 2));\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 150, 255, 0.4), rgba(0, 255, 200, 0.1));\n            box-shadow: inset 0 0 50px rgba(0, 200, 255, 0.4), 0 0 30px rgba(0, 150, 255, 0.3);\n            border-color: rgba(100, 255, 255, 0.7);\n        }\n        /* Top Face (Lighter Teal/White Edge) */\n        .face-top {\n            transform: rotateX(90deg) translateZ(calc(var(--cube-size) / 2));\n            background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(200, 255, 255, 0.6), rgba(0, 150, 255, 0.2));\n            box-shadow: inset 0 20px 40px rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.3);\n            border-color: rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.9);\n            border-bottom-color: rgba(100, 255, 255, 0.5);\n        }\n        /* Right Face (Cyan/Green Gradient) */\n        .face-right {\n            transform: rotateY(90deg) translateZ(calc(var(--cube-size) / 2));\n            background: linear-gradient(135deg, rgba(0, 255, 150, 0.5), rgba(0, 150, 255, 0.2));\n            box-shadow: inset 0 0 30px rgba(0, 255, 100, 0.3);\n            border-color: rgba(100, 255, 200, 0.6);\n            border-left-color: rgba(100, 255, 255, 0.5);\n        }\n        /* Hidden Faces for volume */\n        .face-back, .face-left, .face-bottom {\n            background: rgba(0, 20, 50, 0.4);\n            border-color: rgba(255,255,255,0.05);\n            box-shadow: inset 0 0 20px rgba(0,0,0,0.8);\n        }\n        .face-back { transform: rotateY(180deg) translateZ(calc(var(--cube-size) / 2)); }\n        .face-left { transform: rotateY(-90deg) translateZ(calc(var(--cube-size) / 2)); }\n        .face-bottom { transform: rotateX(-90deg) translateZ(calc(var(--cube-size) / 2)); }\n\n        /* Floating R inside cube */\n        .cube-content {\n            position: absolute;\n            inset: 0;\n            display: flex;\n            align-items: center;\n            justify-content: center;\n            transform: translateZ(calc(var(--cube-size) / 2 + 10px));\n            font-size: calc(var(--cube-size) * 0.2);\n            font-weight: 400; /* Thin-adjusted */\n            color: white;\n            text-shadow: 0 0 20px rgba(255,255,255,0.8);\n            pointer-events: none;\n        }\n\n        /* Border Gradients Skill */\n        .gradient-border-wrap {\n            position: relative;\n            background: linear-gradient(to right, #00c6ff, #0072ff);\n            padding: 1px;\n            border-radius: 0.375rem; /* rounded-md */\n            display: inline-block;\n        }\n        .gradient-border-inner {\n            background: #010409;\n            border-radius: calc(0.375rem - 1px);\n            height: 100%;\n            width: 100%;\n        }\n\n        /* Masked Reveal Styles */\n        .word-wrap {\n            display: inline-block;\n            overflow: hidden;\n            vertical-align: bottom;\n        }\n        .word-inner {\n            display: inline-block;\n            transform: translateY(110%);\n            opacity: 0;\n        }\n    </style>\n</head>\n<body class=\"relative min-h-screen\">\n\n    <!-- Skills: Container Lines -->\n    <div class=\"container-lines\">\n        <div class=\"container-line\"></div>\n        <div class=\"container-line hidden md:block\"></div>\n        <div class=\"container-line\"></div>\n    </div>\n\n    <!-- Background Elements -->\n    <div class=\"neon-beam-glow\"></div>\n    <div class=\"neon-beam-core\"></div>\n    <div class=\"dot-grid-bg hidden lg:block\"></div>\n\n    <!-- Skills: Background Grid WebGL (Particle Flow) -->\n    <canvas id=\"webgl-canvas\"></canvas>\n\n    <!-- Main Layout Wrapper -->\n    <div class=\"relative z-10 w-full max-w-7xl mx-auto min-h-screen flex flex-col px-6 md:px-12\">\n\n        <!-- Header -->\n        <header class=\"w-full py-8 flex justify-between items-center opacity-0 fade-in-delay\">\n            <div class=\"flex items-center gap-1 cursor-pointer\">\n                <span class=\"text-white text-xl md:text-2xl font-medium tracking-tight\">Nexus</span>\n                <sup class=\"text-gray-400 text-xs mt-1\">®</sup>\n            </div>\n\n            <nav class=\"hidden md:flex items-center gap-8\">\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Solutions</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Heritage</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Insights</a>\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"text-sm text-gray-400 hover:text-white transition-colors\">Connect</a>\n\n                <!-- Skill: Border Gradient Button -->\n                <a href=\"#\" class=\"gradient-border-wrap group hover:scale-[1.02] transition-transform\">\n                    <div class=\"gradient-border-inner px-4 py-2 flex items-center gap-2\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-white font-normal\">Gain Entry</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-white/70 group-hover:text-white transition-colors group-hover:translate-x-1 duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </a>\n            </nav>\n            <!-- Mobile Menu Icon -->\n            <button class=\"md:hidden text-white\">\n                <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:hamburger-menu-linear\" width=\"24\"></iconify-icon>\n            </button>\n        </header>\n\n        <!-- Main Content Area -->\n        <main class=\"flex-grow relative w-full h-full\">\n\n            <!-- Top Right Card -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[10%] lg:top-[15%] right-0 w-full max-w-[320px] bg-white/[0.02] backdrop-blur-md border border-white/[0.08] p-6 lg:p-8 rounded-lg shadow-2xl z-20 opacity-0 slide-in-right\">\n                <p class=\"text-white text-base lg:text-lg font-normal tracking-tight leading-snug mb-6\">We engineer systems to accelerate your global operations</p>\n\n                <!-- Skill: Border Gradient Button -->\n                <button class=\"gradient-border-wrap group w-auto\">\n                    <div class=\"gradient-border-inner px-5 py-2.5 flex items-center gap-3\">\n                        <span class=\"text-sm text-white font-normal\">Initialize</span>\n                        <iconify-icon icon=\"solar:arrow-right-linear\" class=\"text-white/70 group-hover:text-white group-hover:translate-x-1 transition-all duration-300\"></iconify-icon>\n                    </div>\n                </button>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Central 3D Cube -->\n            <div class=\"absolute top-[45%] left-1/2 -translate-x-1/2 -translate-y-1/2 z-10 w-full flex justify-center lg:translate-x-0 lg:left-[45%] pointer-events-none\">\n                <div class=\"scene-3d cube-anim\">\n                    <div class=\"cube-wrapper\">\n                        <div class=\"cube-face face-back\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"cube-face face-left\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"cube-face face-bottom\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"cube-face face-front\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"cube-face face-top\"></div>\n                        <div class=\"cube-face face-right\"></div>\n                        <!-- Floating registered mark inside/near the cube's front face -->\n                        <div class=\"cube-content\">®</div>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Left Main Typography -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-[10%] lg:bottom-[15%] left-0 w-full max-w-2xl z-20 pr-4\">\n                <!-- Skill: Masked Reveal Header -->\n                <h1 class=\"text-[12vw] sm:text-[8vw] lg:text-9xl font-semibold text-white tracking-tighter leading-[0.8] mb-6 masked-reveal-target flex flex-wrap gap-x-2\">\n                    Nexus<sup class=\"text-[4vw] sm:text-[3vw] lg:text-5xl mt-4 opacity-80\">®</sup>\n                </h1>\n\n                <p class=\"text-gray-400 text-base sm:text-lg lg:text-xl max-w-sm leading-relaxed opacity-0 fade-up-delay-1\">\n                    Premier AI Collective, we leverage the <span class=\"text-white font-normal\">Quantum Matrix Core and Synapse</span> Framework to elevate your structural capacity.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n            <!-- Bottom Right Secondary Typography -->\n            <div class=\"absolute bottom-[5%] lg:bottom-[10%] right-0 w-full max-w-xs z-20 hidden md:block opacity-0 fade-up-delay-2\">\n                <p class=\"text-gray-500 text-sm lg:text-base leading-relaxed\">\n                    <span class=\"text-gray-300 font-normal tracking-tight\">Advanced neural networks, optimized processing,</span> and exponential scaling through our integrated predictive models.\n                </p>\n            </div>\n\n        </main>\n    </div>\n\n    <script>\n        // --- 1. Text Splitting Utility for Masked Reveal ---\n        function splitText(selector) {\n            const el = document.querySelector(selector);\n            if(!el) return;\n            const text = el.childNodes;\n            let newHTML = '';\n\n            // Very basic split that handles the sup tag specially for this specific layout\n            text.forEach(node => {\n                if (node.nodeType === 3) { // Text node\n                    const words = node.textContent.trim().split(/\\s+/);\n                    words.forEach(word => {\n                        if(word.length > 0) {\n                            newHTML += `<span class=\"word-wrap\"><span class=\"word-inner\">${word}</span></span> `;\n                        }\n                    });\n                } else if (node.nodeType === 1) { // Element node (like sup)\n                    newHTML += `<span class=\"word-wrap\"><span class=\"word-inner\">${node.outerHTML}</span></span> `;\n                }\n            });\n            el.innerHTML = newHTML;\n        }\n\n        // Apply splitting\n        splitText('.masked-reveal-target');\n\n        // --- 2. GSAP Animations ---\n        document.addEventListener(\"DOMContentLoaded\", (event) => {\n            gsap.registerPlugin();\n\n            const tl = gsap.timeline({ defaults: { ease: \"power3.out\" } });\n\n            // Animate masked text\n            tl.to('.word-inner', {\n                y: '0%',\n                opacity: 1,\n                duration: 1,\n                stagger: 0.15,\n                delay: 0.2\n            });\n\n            // Fade in surrounding elements\n            tl.to('.fade-in-delay', { opacity: 1, duration: 1 }, \"-=0.5\");\n            tl.to('.slide-in-right', { x: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 1, ease: \"power2.out\", onStart: () => gsap.set('.slide-in-right', {x: 50}) }, \"-=0.8\");\n            tl.to('.fade-up-delay-1', { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 1, onStart: () => gsap.set('.fade-up-delay-1', {y: 20}) }, \"-=0.6\");\n            tl.to('.fade-up-delay-2', { y: 0, opacity: 1, duration: 1, onStart: () => gsap.set('.fade-up-delay-2', {y: 20}) }, \"-=0.8\");\n\n            // Continuous slow float for the 3D Cube\n            gsap.to('.cube-anim', {\n                y: -20,\n                rotationX: 5,\n                rotationY: -5,\n                duration: 4,\n                ease: \"sine.inOut\",\n                yoyo: true,\n                repeat: -1\n            });\n        });\n\n        // --- 3. WebGL Background (Subtle Particle Flow) ---\n        const canvas = document.getElementById('webgl-canvas');\n        const renderer = new THREE.WebGLRenderer({ canvas, alpha: true, antialias: true });\n        renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        renderer.setPixelRatio(Math.min(window.devicePixelRatio, 2));\n\n        const scene = new THREE.Scene();\n\n        // Faint, dark grid mapped to new blue/teal hues\n        const gridHelper = new THREE.GridHelper(100, 40, 0x112233, 0x0a111a);\n        gridHelper.position.y = -10;\n        gridHelper.position.z = -20;\n        gridHelper.rotation.x = Math.PI / 2.2;\n        gridHelper.material.transparent = true;\n        gridHelper.material.opacity = 0.1;\n        scene.add(gridHelper);\n\n        const camera = new THREE.PerspectiveCamera(45, window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight, 0.1, 100);\n        camera.position.z = 20;\n\n        // Particle system to simulate dust in the neon beam\n        const particlesGeometry = new THREE.BufferGeometry();\n        const particlesCount = 300;\n        const posArray = new Float32Array(particlesCount * 3);\n\n        for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i+=3) {\n            // Distribute particles mainly along the top-left to bottom-right diagonal\n            posArray[i] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 40; // x\n            posArray[i+1] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 30; // y\n            posArray[i+2] = (Math.random() - 0.5) * 15; // z\n        }\n\n        particlesGeometry.setAttribute('position', new THREE.BufferAttribute(posArray, 3));\n\n        const material = new THREE.PointsMaterial({\n            size: 0.05,\n            color: 0x88ffff, // Teal-ish white\n            transparent: true,\n            opacity: 0.6,\n            blending: THREE.AdditiveBlending\n        });\n\n        const particlesMesh = new THREE.Points(particlesGeometry, material);\n        // Rotate entire system to roughly match the CSS beam angle\n        particlesMesh.rotation.z = -0.4;\n        scene.add(particlesMesh);\n\n        // Mouse interaction\n        let mouseX = 0;\n        let mouseY = 0;\n        let targetX = 0;\n        let targetY = 0;\n\n        document.addEventListener('mousemove', (event) => {\n            mouseX = (event.clientX - window.innerWidth / 2) / 2000;\n            mouseY = (event.clientY - window.innerHeight / 2) / 2000;\n        });\n\n        const clock = new THREE.Clock();\n\n        function animate() {\n            requestAnimationFrame(animate);\n            const elapsedTime = clock.getElapsedTime();\n\n            // Slow continuous drift\n            particlesMesh.rotation.y = elapsedTime * 0.02;\n\n            // Move particles along the 'beam' axis slowly\n            const positions = particlesMesh.geometry.attributes.position.array;\n            for(let i = 0; i < particlesCount * 3; i += 3) {\n                positions[i] += 0.01; // move right\n                positions[i+1] -= 0.005; // move down\n\n                // Reset particles if they go too far right/down to create continuous flow\n                if (positions[i] > 20 || positions[i+1] < -15) {\n                    positions[i] = -20 + (Math.random() * 10);\n                    positions[i+1] = 15 - (Math.random() * 5);\n                }\n            }\n            particlesMesh.geometry.attributes.position.needsUpdate = true;\n\n            // Parallax mouse effect\n            targetX = mouseX * 0.5;\n            targetY = mouseY * 0.5;\n\n            camera.position.x += (targetX - camera.position.x) * 0.05;\n            camera.position.y += (-targetY - camera.position.y) * 0.05;\n            camera.lookAt(scene.position);\n\n            renderer.render(scene, camera);\n        }\n        animate();\n\n        // Handle Resize\n        window.addEventListener('resize', () => {\n            camera.aspect = window.innerWidth / window.innerHeight;\n            camera.updateProjectionMatrix();\n            renderer.setSize(window.innerWidth, window.innerHeight);\n        });\n\n    </script>\n</body>\n</html>", "preview_file_name": "nexus-core-infrastructure.html", "thumbnail_url": "https://hoirqrkdgbmvpwutwuwj.supabase.co/storage/v1/object/public/design-system-thumbnails/regenerated-2026-05-22-2s/nexus-core-infrastructure.jpg", "source_name": "nexus-core-infrastructure-DESIGN.md", "views": 161, "forks": 11, "private": false, "featured": true, "created_by": "5bd6211c-bd4c-467c-b442-4312cac4712c", "created_at": "2026-05-01T16:18:09.070118+00:00", "updated_at": "2026-07-03T14:43:46.857171+00:00"}